# Bisleri Gate Entry App — API Configuration Template
#
# HOW TO USE:
#   1. Copy this file and rename the copy to .env
#   2. Fill in the correct URL for your environment
#   3. Never commit .env to GitHub — only .env.example is committed
#
# ----------------------------------------------------------------
# OPTION A — Production / Server (API goes through Nginx)
#   Use this on the server machine or when accessing via public URL
# ----------------------------------------------------------------
# EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://123.63.20.237:19000/api

# ----------------------------------------------------------------
# OPTION B — Local Development (API goes directly to backend)
#   Replace YOUR_LOCAL_IP with your machine's IP (e.g. 192.168.1.35)
#   Run: ipconfig (Windows) or ifconfig (Mac/Linux) to find your IP
# ----------------------------------------------------------------
# EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://YOUR_LOCAL_IP:8000

EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://YOUR_LOCAL_IP:8000